                "word": "géotextile",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "844c6590-91cc-4b01-b87c-0c8fe96e557b",
                        "entry_id": "b1558850-0654-39d2-8c50-829b3aa2a307",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "géotextiles"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                        "entry_id": "b1558850-0654-39d2-8c50-829b3aa2a307",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tissu synthétique destiné aux travaux de bâtiment, de génie civil et d’agriculture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e0f9667-9b6d-461d-9b94-fef4361a0201",
                                "sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                                "text": "« Les engins de chantier passaient partout, sur toute la conduite, même là où il n’y avait pas de géotextile (protection spéciale pour les conduites ndlr) », a-t-il insisté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9bbbf6d-180d-4874-9835-7942e824e305",
                                "sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                                "text": "Il faut alors le recouvrir d’une couche de 5 cm de sable ou d’une toile géotextile avant de placer une bâche."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a79003e-4039-404b-b674-ff95cb5b0e9e",
                                "sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                                "text": "Le Comité français des géosynthétiques (CFG) a publié en 1981 un fascicule de recommandations pour l'emploi des géotextiles dans les voies de circulation provisoire, les voies à faible trafic et les couches de forme."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "354436e4-f8bc-4342-82c4-4392ed249f0b",
                        "source_entry_id": "b1558850-0654-39d2-8c50-829b3aa2a307",
                        "source_sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                        "target_lang_word": "Geotextil",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "572f97d6-4d47-4cd9-83ba-a4c07eefdf87",
                        "source_entry_id": "b1558850-0654-39d2-8c50-829b3aa2a307",
                        "source_sense_id": "e9f3fb94-30c2-3696-bdb0-8c80306dce81",
                        "target_lang_word": "geotextile",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geotextile",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b2babf6-3575-35cb-aad7-320988bd0703",
                                        "entry_id": "d25c5be2-b92e-3c3c-9dfa-782b77cc552f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any strong, permeable fabric used in earthworks for any of a number of purposes, including separation of soil layers, filtering, reinforcing, erosion protection and protection of drainage pipes from clogging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dccf0db-4389-46be-b9e6-1e7367ced2d8",
                                                "sense_id": "3b2babf6-3575-35cb-aad7-320988bd0703",
                                                "text": "You need to excavate and remove the topsoil, line the subsoil with a geotextile, then lay and compact hardcore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be6a1f4d-5b7d-49d8-a9bb-0a261c201751",
                                                "sense_id": "3b2babf6-3575-35cb-aad7-320988bd0703",
                                                "text": "The design also included geotextile lining of the trench in which the drainage pipe was buried."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
